# --- Contact form delivery (Web3Forms) ---
# The contact form's Web3Forms access key is set directly in
# `content/site.ts` (contactFormAccessKey). It is PUBLIC by design — embedded
# in the client bundle, and only permits sending mail to the registered
# inbox — so it is safe to commit and needs no environment configuration.
#
# This variable is OPTIONAL: set it only if you want to override the committed
# key without editing code (e.g. a different key per environment). If set at
# build time, it takes precedence over the value in content/site.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
